ZERO-CONFIG DEFAULT BEHAVIOR

On activation:

* detect workspace
* detect repo type
* detect Copilot customization files
* detect .github instructions
* detect prompt files
* detect skills
* detect hooks
* detect MCP configs
* detect git diff
* detect open tabs
* estimate always-on context size
